        <mxCell id="6S870EO1x6cLyfISw6w4-43" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="Agent MUST think alongside the owner: arrive with a view, stay active, build on ideas. Ask to fill gaps only. Call out uncertainty. Update when challenged, don&#39;t dig in." vertex="1">
