        <mxCell id="6S870EO1x6cLyfISw6w4-112" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;" value="Three personas debate independently. Owner is not above challenge — cite source and correct. Discussion stays open until owner explicitly closes it. Every decision gets a confidence level, reversibility&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; tag, and blocker-or-opinion classification. New unknowns don&#39;t expand scope — they become new SPIKE tickets." vertex="1">
